# Kulan OS: the boot loader for older PCs that start in BIOS (legacy) mode,
# kept in the ISO's package pool for Kulan Installer and Calamares.
# It conflicts with the UEFI boot loader (grub-efi-amd64), so it has a list
# of its own: live-build downloads each list separately (see
# installer.list.binary for the rest).
#if ARCHITECTURES amd64
grub-pc
#endif
